1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,877
Stopping Earth is bad.

2
00:00:01,897 --> 00:00:03,740
Restarting it is worse.

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:05,010
Say Earth stops for one

4
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,554
second, then starts spinning

5
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:07,641
again, instantly.

6
00:00:07,661 --> 00:00:09,137
Anything still flying east is

7
00:00:09,137 --> 00:00:10,442
suddenly back in sync with

8
00:00:10,442 --> 00:00:11,219
the ground.

9
00:00:11,239 --> 00:00:12,268
Lucky.

10
00:00:12,288 --> 00:00:13,359
But everything that crashed

11
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:14,987
and stopped during that second?

12
00:00:15,007 --> 00:00:16,386
The ground races back under

13
00:00:16,386 --> 00:00:17,497
it at full speed.

14
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:19,569
So the whole disaster happens again...

15
00:00:19,589 --> 00:00:20,821
in the other direction.

16
00:00:22,171 --> 00:00:23,618
Physics would like a word.

17
00:00:23,638 --> 00:00:25,218
Earth's spin stores about

18
00:00:25,218 --> 00:00:28,648
2×10²⁹ joules of energy.

19
00:00:28,668 --> 00:00:29,999
Stopping it means dumping all

20
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:30,934
of that somewhere.

21
00:00:30,954 --> 00:00:32,004
That's roughly what the Sun

22
00:00:32,004 --> 00:00:33,459
pours out in nine minutes.

23
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:34,367
All of the Sun.

24
00:00:35,717 --> 00:00:37,778
And if Earth never started again?

25
00:00:37,798 --> 00:00:38,801
One day would last a

26
00:00:38,801 --> 00:00:39,495
whole year.

27
00:00:39,515 --> 00:00:40,995
Six months of daylight,

28
00:00:41,015 --> 00:00:42,389
then six months of night.

29
00:00:42,409 --> 00:00:43,355
And the Sun would rise

30
00:00:43,355 --> 00:00:44,150
in the west.

31
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:45,030
Over time,

32
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,029
the oceans would migrate

33
00:00:46,029 --> 00:00:47,110
toward the poles,

34
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,455
leaving one giant continent

35
00:00:48,455 --> 00:00:50,153
wrapped around the equator.

36
00:00:50,173 --> 00:00:51,620
Subscribe for more what ifs!
